<title>USA: Continental Air October load factor rises.</title>
<headline>Continental Air October load factor rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		 1995</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  66.1		65.7</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	     3,498	     3,190</p>
<p> Available seat miles		  5,296	     4,853</p>
<p>					    Year-to-date</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  68.6		65.8</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	    35,078	    33,778</p>
<p> Available seat miles		 51,132	    51,362</p>
<p>(Revenue passenger and available seat miles in 000,000s)</p>
<p>NOTE: October cargo revenue ton miles 48.3 million vs 38.6 million.</p>
</text>
